category: Science
requires: cygwin libgcc1 liblapack0 libqhull_8 libstdc++6 libsuperlu7
sdesc: "Generic and transparent finite element library (runtime)"
ldesc: "GetFEM is an open source library based on collaborative
development. It aims to offer the most flexible framework for solving
potentially coupled systems of linear and nonlinear partial differential
equations with the finite element method. It works in arbitrary dimension and
allows to couple 1D, 2D and 3D problems."
external-source: getfem

